{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026P67e1S2TvS1795601784.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>環球金融市場，尤其是美股，近期相當波動，俗稱「恐慌指數」的VIX更一度升至超過一年高位。</p><p></p><p>VIX全名是芝加哥期權交易所市場波動率指數，是按標準普爾500指數的期權價格，計算的未來30日波幅指標。VIX指數越高，反映標普500指數期權投資者對於市場前景越感到不安，意味市況將變得波動。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261125_QQ.VIX.CLEAN.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FSpLWd6uex1795601837.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>根據過往數據分析，指數低於15，反映市場相對平穩，預期波動較低。介乎15至20時，反映市況正常，或處於中性波動區間。升至20至30，便意味市況不確定性增加，避險情緒升溫。當指數升至30或以上，代表市場接近恐慌狀態。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261125_QQ.VIX.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kpFyFtNDOu1795601852.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>不過亦有分析認為，當指數升至40，可視為買入訊號。從1990年以來，VIX有13次觸及40水平，之後一個月，標普500指數都錄得相對可觀的回報率。</p><p></p><p>所謂有危便有機，恐慌指數VIX並非只是一個跌市指數，更可能是一個入市指數。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12745-%E4%BB%A5%E8%89%B2%E5%88%97%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%9B%E6%8A%95%E7%9F%B3%E7%B4%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:03:59.532513+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.105561+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:57:18.271776+00:00","content_hash":"cba2c77a180c4ccd1a06bfc70b7dd27df0cbb42ed815aa3c29ea6ecf68d07873","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:03:59.532513+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}